const RV_NOTE=['SW + prestress after elastic shortening (cl. 3.4.2.2); force shown is the value at the selected age','Relaxation after transfer, cl. 3.3.4.3, reduced by Eq. 3.4.3.4','Shrinkage with bonded-steel restraint, cl. 3.1.7.2 / 3.4.3.2','Creep, cl. 3.1.8.3 (k9 on the transfer increment), restraint by bonded steel – bare girder, no deck','Deck and SIDL on the composite section – the design long-term value'];
